    <node id="state">
      <data key="d0">state</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The entity referred to as "state" has been described in various contexts, each highlighting different attributes such as IDs, URLs, and keys. It is consistently identified by a unique identifier, which varies across descriptions. For instance, one description mentions the identifier '463507b849a4'. The URLs associated with this entity point to diverse pages, including an electronics page, an electronics category page, and a sales and guest form orders and returns page. Additionally, there is a mention of a login URL and a contact URL, indicating the multifaceted nature of this entity. The presence of a key suggests that the state entity might have some form of authentication or access control mechanism. Overall, the state entity is characterized by its specific ID and various URLs, each serving different purposes within the system.&lt;SEP&gt;A state entity with the identifier '680c93c4dbc4'.</data>
      <data key="d3">doc-0313cdbbf9e37e1899a0a0af02cdac29-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1961f4266e6b80fa16bbc592b99de29d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-56ee8cfaad4c3e7787c80d633f3b9fb2-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-80ff16dfcb43a231a5b62c9f95f56be9-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8d32db36985b997241737a36c8273ebf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f32503d57dbcfb55e9966b8addb40d5f-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-1761098ff20f891ff04716299843abaf-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-7aca32fb89c5bf0ba28f8edd9e43b4e5-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-8958b6983df1cc2819a9f3f0c180b996-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-e7b4da8b6c531d24274ef4d30231b38a-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-f7e2f7ace4b7e7623955ea0f39973b12-chunk-000</data>
