    <edge source="goal" target="task_id">
      <data key="d7">14.0</data>
      <data key="d8">The task "guest_open_contact_form" is designed to achieve a specific goal, which involves opening the Contact Us page. This task requires the user to navigate through various pages, including the Orders and Returns page, but it explicitly states that the task should not open the Forgot Password page or the My Account page. Additionally, the task specifies that the user should scroll to the homepage footer and avoid signing in.&lt;SEP&gt;The task ID is associated with the goal.&lt;SEP&gt;The task ID is related to the goal.</data>
      <data key="d9">Do NOT open Forgot Password,Do NOT open My Account,Do NOT sign in,Done when the Orders and Returns page is open,Objective,Open the guest link "Orders and Returns",Scroll to the homepage footer,has_goal,is related to</data>
